# EngDi

Monorepo: `MainApi` (NestJS/Prisma), `AdminPanel` (Next.js), `UserPanel` (Next.js), docs in `docs/Project/`.

Before non-trivial work, read `AGENTS.md` and the relevant file under `docs/Project/`.

Never commit `.env`, secrets, `node_modules`, `uploads`, `.next`, or `dist`. Use `*/.env.example` only.
